<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκᾰλέω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-καλέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hom.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					14.8
				</span></i>
			, 
				Att.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-καλῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.1.46
				</span></i>
			: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>call to council, convoke, convene</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				517
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i> l.c., etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς γυναῖκας ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινὰς παρεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>invite with others to</i> a feast, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. αὐτοῖς καὶ Ἀρτάβαζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.4.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
